sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FE as Frontend OmniParserStatus
    participant API as /api/v1/health
    participant DB as Database
    participant R as Redis/Broker
    participant OP as OmniParser /health

    FE->>API: GET /health (every 10s)
    alt cache hit (TTL 5s)
        API-->>FE: cached response
    else cache miss
        par DB probe
            API->>DB: SELECT 1 (timeout 2.0s)
            DB-->>API: ok/down
        and Celery/Redis probe
            API->>R: ping broker redis (timeout 2.0s)
            R-->>API: ok/down
        and OmniParser probe
            API->>OP: GET /health
            Note right of API: httpx timeout connect=1.0s read=2.5s\nasyncio total timeout=3.5s
            OP-->>API: 200 -> ok / else loading/down
        end
        API->>API: aggregate service states
        API-->>FE: healthy/degraded + services
    end

    Note over API,OP: Root cause fixed:\nold probe timeout too tight (~1.0-1.5s latency window)\ncaused false down while direct call still succeeded.
